        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Siân Gibson, Peter Kay\n- Works: Peter Kay's Car Share\n- Awards: BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy, National Television Award for Best Comedy\n- Roles: Actress, writer, supermarket assistant manager, promotions rep\n\nFacts:\n- Siân Gibson was born as Siân Foulkes on 15 July 1976 and is a Welsh actress and writer.\n- Siân Gibson is best known for collaborating with Peter Kay, including starring in and co-writing the comedy series Peter Kay's Car Share.\n- In 2016, Peter Kay's Car Share won the BAFTA TV Award for Best Scripted Comedy and the National Television Award for Best Comedy for Siân Gibson.\n- Peter Kay's Car Share is a British sitcom about supermarket assistant manager John Redmond, played by Peter Kay, and promotions rep Kayleigh Kitson, played by Siân Gibson, taking part in a company car share scheme.",
